<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>MH Demand — Geo-attributed · Allo Health</title>
<style>
:root{--bg:#f5f6f4;--card:#fff;--ink:#1c2430;--muted:#7a8290;--line:#e6e8ea;--accent:#2c6cae}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font:14px/1.4 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink)}
.wrap{max-width:1500px;margin:0 auto;padding:22px 26px}
h1{font-size:21px;margin:0 0 2px}.sub{color:var(--muted);font-size:12.5px;margin-bottom:16px}
.tabs{display:flex;gap:4px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);margin-bottom:16px}
.tab{padding:9px 16px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;color:var(--muted);border-bottom:2px solid transparent;font-size:13px}
.tab.on{color:var(--accent);border-bottom-color:var(--accent)}
table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;background:var(--card);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
th,td{padding:7px 10px;text-align:right;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);white-space:nowrap}
th{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600;position:sticky;top:0;background:var(--card);cursor:pointer}
th.l,td.l{text-align:left}
td.city{font-weight:600;text-align:left}
.tot{font-weight:700}
.natrow td{background:#eef1ee;font-weight:600;border-top:2px solid #cfd6cd}
.controls{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
select,input{padding:6px 9px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;font-size:13px;background:#fff}
.pill{display:inline-block;padding:1px 7px;border-radius:10px;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;color:#fff}
.muted{color:var(--muted)}.hide{display:none}
.note{color:var(--muted);font-size:11.5px;margin-top:10px}
.scroll{max-height:74vh;overflow:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px}
</style></head><body><div class="wrap">
<h1>MH keyword demand — geo-attributed <span class="muted" style="font-weight:400">· city × category · Allo Health · DataForSEO location-targeted pull</span></h1>
<div class="sub">Every keyword's search volume pulled <b>per city</b> (Google Ads location targeting), so "near me" demand is bucketed into the city it comes from — not dumped into a National row.</div>
<div class="tabs"><div class="tab on" data-t="matrix">City × Category matrix</div><div class="tab" data-t="query">Query view</div></div>
<div id="matrix"></div>
<div id="query" class="hide"></div>
</div>
